  <div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4 hero-content-centered"><div class="subtitle">January 21, 2023</div><h1>Wine lovers, rejoice! The French Riviera is home to some of the world's most renowned vineyards</h1></div></div></div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper" style='background-image:url("https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a84eae3b0bb/63dba623e12d683d773b45f1_rodrigo-abreu-Cj4CWKQllOM-unsplash.jpg")'></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div class="blog-post w-richtext"><p>Visite This historic vineyard, once owned by fashion designer Christian Dior, produces a variety of red, white, and rosé wines. Take a tour of the château and enjoy a tasting of their wines in the beautiful gardens.</p><p>Explore the wines of Côtes de Provence at Château Saint-Martin &amp; spa. This stunning vineyard not only produces some of the region's best wines but also offers a spa and an infinity pool. Enjoy a private wine tasting experience while taking in the breathtaking views of the Mediterranean Sea.</p><p>‍</p><figure class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image" style="max-width:6000px"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg"/></div></figure><p>‍</p><p>Take a tour of the historic cellars of Château Minuty. This family-owned vineyard is famous for its rosé wines, and a tour of the cellars will give you a glimpse into the wine-making process. End the tour with a tasting of their wines and a cheese pairing.</p><p>Attend a wine-making workshop at Domaine de la Citadelle. This family-run vineyard offers a unique experience where you can learn about wine-making and blend your own wine to take home.</p><p>Experience the wines of the Bellet wine route. This picturesque route takes you through the vineyards of the Bellet region, known for producing some of the best rosé wines in France. Stop at several vineyards to taste their wines and learn about the history and terroir of the region.</p><p>‍</p><figure class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image" style="max-width:4256px"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg"/></div></figure><p>‍</p><p>These are just a few of the many wine experiences available in the area surrounding Hotel Toile Blanche. Whether you're a wine connoisseur or simply enjoy a glass of wine with your meal, the French Riviera offers something for everyone. Book your stay at Hotel Toile Blanche and discover the beauty and culture of the region, all while indulging in some of the world's finest wines.</p><p>‍</p><p>‍</p></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Continue reading</h2></div></div><div class="container no-padding-mobile"><div class="blog-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="blog-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="blog-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="collection-link-block w-inline-block" href="best-places-to-eat-the-tastiest-local-food-around-toile-blanche.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0bd0acfefc8c5b.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle">Best places to eat the tastiest local food around Toile Blanche</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="blog-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="collection-link-block w-inline-block" href="self-guided-tour-itinarary.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="A self-guided tour itinerary of the area surrounding Hotel Toile Blanche in Vence, French Riviera." class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-4096fb7a8a053f.jpg"/></div><div clas